<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Explain which relations are omitted from a Hasse diagram.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Draw the Hasse diagram of the divisors of <m>18</m> ordered by divisibility.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

